{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Math Master": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) x<sup>3</sup> = -8 হলে x + 2 = ?", "option1": "ক) -1", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x<sup>3</sup> = -8<br />বা, x<sup>3</sup> + 8 = 0<br />বা, x<sup>3</sup> + 2<sup>3</sup> = 0<br />(x + 2)(x<sup>2</sup> - 2x + 4) = 0<br />হয়,<br />x + 2 = 0<br />অথবা,<br />x<sup>2</sup> - 2x + 4 = 0</p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = 17 এবং x - y = 3 হলে (x, y) = ?", "option1": "ক) (4, 1)", "option2": "খ) (1, 4)", "option3": "গ) (-4, 1)", "option4": "ঘ) (4, -1)", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>x - y = 3<br />(x - y)<sup>2</sup> = 9<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> - 2xy = 9<br />বা, 17 - 2xy = 9<br />2xy = 17 - 9 = 8<br />&there4; xy = 4 = 4.1<br />&there4; x = 4, y = 1 হলে<br />x - y = 3</p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) ax - by = 0 এবং ay - bx = a<sup>2</sup> - b<sup>2</sup> হলে y = ?", "option1": "ক) -a", "option2": "খ) -b", "option3": "গ) a", "option4": "ঘ) b", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>ax - by = 0<br />বা, ax = by<br />&there4; x = (b/a)y<br />আবার,<br />ay - bx = a<sup>2</sup> - b<sup>2</sup><br />বা, ay - b.(b/a)y = a<sup>2</sup> - b<sup>2</sup><br />বা, y(a - b<sup>2</sup>/a) = a<sup>2</sup> - b<sup>2</sup><br />y&nbsp;&times; (a<sup>2</sup> - b<sup>2</sup>)/a = a<sup>2</sup> - b<sup>2</sup><br />বা, y/a = 1<br />&there4; y = a</p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) 2/x + 3/y = 2 এবং 5/2 - 2/y = 5 হলে x = ?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) 2", "option4": "ঘ) 3", "answer": "0", "exp": "<p>প্রদত্ত সমীকরণ,<br />2/x + 3/y = 2.......(1)<br />5/x - 2/y = 5........(2)<br />(1) নং&nbsp;&times; 2 + (2) নং&nbsp;&times; 3<br />4/x + 15/x = 4 + 15<br />বা, 19/x = 19<br />&there4; x = 1<br /><br /><br />প্রশ্নে 5/2 এর স্থলে 5/x হওয়ার কথা ছিলো।<br />টাইপের ভুল থাকায় উত্তর বাতিল করা হয়েছে।</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) x/y = 3 এবং x + 2y = 15 হলে x = ?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1", "optio